    <bpmn:process id="W_W3112" name="W3112. Dark Store Sustainability, Energy &amp; Waste Optimization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual sustainability review; ESG reporting cycle (links to VS-25)
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: Per dark store and network
Owner: Dark Store Operations Manager
Participants: Dark Store Ops Mgr, Sustainability Lead (links to VS-25), Facilities, Procurement (links to VS-34)
Source: workflow W3112 — Dark Store Sustainability, Energy &amp; Waste Optimization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3112_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3112_Lane1" name="Sustainability Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3112_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3112_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3112_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3112_Lane2" name="Dark Store Ops Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3112_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3112_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3112_Start4" name="Annual sustainability review; ESG reporting cycle (links to VS-25)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3112_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3112_Task5" name="Sustainability Lead (links to VS-25) measures dark-store footprint: energy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability Lead (links to VS-25) measures dark-store footprint: energy (kWh/order — automation, lighting, HVAC), packaging waste (carton, void-fill, tape per order), and last-mile CO₂; benchmarks vs. ship-from-store
Responsible (R): Sustainability Lead
Accountable (A): Dark Store Operations Manager
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3112_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3112_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3112_Task6" name="Dark Store Ops Mgr/Procurement execute reduction initiatives: right-box…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Dark Store Ops Mgr/Procurement execute reduction initiatives: right-box cartonization (reduces void-fill), recyclable/compostable packaging, motion-sensor LED, automation energy saver, route consolidation (links to VS-06/VS-56)
Responsible (R): Dark Store Ops Mgr / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3112_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3112_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3112_Task7" name="Sustainability Lead reports dark-store emissions and waste into Scope 1/2/3…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability Lead reports dark-store emissions and waste into Scope 1/2/3 inventory (links to VS-25 W192); supports retailer ESG disclosure and any packaging-extended-producer-responsibility (EPR) obligation
Responsible (R): Sustainability Lead
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3112_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3112_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3112_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3112_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3112_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-510 (ensure controlled execution — Dark Store Inventory, Capacity &amp; Performance Analytics (PA-93.3).) | - operational: recyclable-first procurement and waste tracking (links to VS-73)
Owner: Dark Store Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
